<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to June 6.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Price   pct change</p>
<p> 1  Sthn Pac Pete	   4.70   28.77</p>
<p> 2  Hudson Conway	  13.90    7.34</p>
<p> 3  Orogen Minerals	 3.80    6.74</p>
<p> 4  Howard Smith	   12.40    5.08</p>
<p> 5  Oil Search		3.46    5.07</p>
<p> 6  Aust Foundation	 2.52    5.00</p>
<p> 7  Argo Inv		  3.23    4.60</p>
<p> 8  Macquarie Bank	  9.85    4.12</p>
<p> 9  David Jones	     1.84    3.95</p>
<p>10  Crown		     2.18    3.81</p>
<p>Top 10 largest falls in week</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Price   pct change</p>
<p> 1  Rothmans		  8.00   -11.11</p>
<p> 2  PMP Comms		 3.30    -8.33</p>
<p> 3  Qni Ltd		   2.52    -6.32</p>
<p> 4  M.I.M. Hlds	     1.85    -5.61</p>
<p> 5  Fh Faulding	     7.40    -5.37</p>
<p> 6  Reinsurance Aust	3.93    -5.30</p>
<p> 7  Comalco		   7.00    -4.11</p>
<p> 8  Flc-Building Div	3.55    -4.05</p>
<p> 9  Mayne Nickless	  7.53    -3.71</p>
<p>10  News Corp-Prefd	 4.76    -3.64</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
